Package: dem30mDownloadR
Type: Package
Title: Download 30 Meter GEDTM30 Elevation Data
Version: 0.1.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: person("Yihao", "Xin", email = "xinyihao123@foxmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Yihao Xin [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Yihao Xin <xinyihao123@foxmail.com>
Description: Downloads 30 meter global elevation data from OpenTopography
    for a polygon boundary. The package reads an API key from a local text
    file, supports GeoJSON and shapefile boundaries, automatically selects a
    meter-based UTM coordinate reference system, and writes a masked GeoTIFF.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    sf,
    terra
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
